        "type": "Text",
        "data": "The project is generally lauded for its Spanish-inspired design, extensive amenities, and strategic location with good connectivity; however, some prospective buyers have raised concerns regarding high pricing, potential infrastructure issues like storm water drains and high tension wires, and a perceived dependency on water tankers."
