    {
      "key": "best_quote",
      "value": {
        "type": "Text",
        "data": "Its expensive, can't walk down to Metro station it is far. They will have some commercial space also coming up in the same project adjacent to the main road. Rest went through few reviews. High priced without basic amenities like utility and balcony in 3BHK. The builder is reputed but there are reports of SWD passing from the land. There is high tension wire passing above the project. Why will someone spend crores to see a wire passing via their residence. So please do your checks before jumping to buy."
      },
      "confidence": 0.5,
      "source": {
        "source_type": "Google",
